      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To be honest this new system messes up with a lot of avatars and bones so I have to turn it off in performace, hair is twitching hands spazing left right the whole idea of dynamic bones is not bad but it breaks a lot of creations so I rather not play with that... Honestly can't VRC release something  decent that wont break something. I am here asking please do it cos they are on something then it just breaks",
