      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "clarification: in dynamicbones, the various values of the dynamicbone component could be altered using an animation. \nwith physbones, the only value that can change is the toggle on or off state. allowing animations to take control of these settings is important for many avatars.\nif performance is a concern in such a fix, this feature should be part of the 'is animated' flag to help with that.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
